Hey all,

My gripe is not so much with the windows, but the fact that 3.1.3 runs MUCH
slower on my LC w/030 than 3.1.1 did. The mouse doesn't move the character 
smoothly anymore, it only moves him one move for every time you click the mouse.
I also feel the old menu bar was much better than the new one.

One more thing. When I set the options in a game and I get killed, they
revert back to default when I start a new game. In 3.1.1, they stayed the
same if I started a new game. Is there a way to make it permanent?

I DO like most of the improvements that were made, but I think a few steps
backward were also taken. I really would like to find out why it is so much
slower now.

